------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1000 sold out
Text=Thank you, spiritbearer. If you wish to return later, I'm expecting a new shipment of rare goods that might interest you.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 marco boots
Text=Ah - forgive Weng Choi his staring, spirit bearer. Those boots you carry. In my homeland a spirit is not pushed into a thing as a cork is pushed into a bottle; it is invited, and it is made comfortable. Whoever shut this one in did it in great haste, and it has been fretting at the seams ever since. Bring me the tusk of an ogre and the venom sack of a snake, and I will settle it properly.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will find them.
Go to node ID=03 Return Dialogue
Custom Action=CActivateQuestStateAction
{
Quest=Levels/1 Barcelona/Quests/Gate District/Bring exotic creature parts back to Weng Choi
State=MPRD4K7X
}
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=They are dead men's errands. Another time.
Go to node ID=03 Return Dialogue
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=902 marco parts
Text=Ah, both - and neither easily got. The boots also, if you please. Weng Choi does not hurry this part. There. The leather has drunk what it needed, and the spirit inside has stopped turning round and round to face the way you are walking. Listen to him - he is pleased. I have no Venetian, spirit bearer, but one does not need the words. Wear them. He will carry you further than he managed himself.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then I had better keep walking.
Go to node ID=03 Return Dialogue
