Node ID=904 marco needs the boots
Text=And the boots, spirit bearer? No, no - put these away. A tusk is a tusk, and a sack of venom is a sack of venom; neither is worth the carrying unless there is something to work them into. You did not hunt these for their own sake. Bring Weng Choi the boots and bring these also, and we shall have a trade.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will come back with them.
